    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/08904cf995bd12a622d3b1d9ee006b2a.poster.avif?t=1702923166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/08904cf995bd12a622d3b1d9ee006b2a.webm?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/08904cf995bd12a622d3b1d9ee006b2a.mp4?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Sanguine tells the story of Yona, a cursed warrior in her quest for revenge as she battles her way through a dry medieval world filled with blood powered machines.<br>Expect advanced combat involving weapon switching, blood ability, intense boss fight and explore a complex world with a rich narrative to follow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/9bdb0c7eff4858cddbb435b8598d5fc5.poster.avif?t=1702923166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/9bdb0c7eff4858cddbb435b8598d5fc5.webm?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/9bdb0c7eff4858cddbb435b8598d5fc5.mp4?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Project Background</strong></h2>Developed initially as a student graduation project, we decided to continue working on it hoping to release it one day. We're a group of 3 passionate artists who love inventing unique worlds, characters, fun gameplay mechanics or just creating games of all kinds.  <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/bb5fab67471d2b2accb2654028f5402f.poster.avif?t=1702923166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/bb5fab67471d2b2accb2654028f5402f.webm?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/bb5fab67471d2b2accb2654028f5402f.mp4?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Future of Sanguine</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A playable demo of Sanguine release in September<br></li><li> Devlogs for a deeper look at the project development<br></li><li> A Discord Server for play-testing and feedback</li></ul>Sanguine is still very early in development, but if you are interested you can follow us to witness the evolution of the project. Join the community, it would mean a lot to us ! <br><br><br>                                                                                                                                                                                     Thank you for any kind support!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/8fe227312f20f8cb8ee9fd7d4572206b.avif?t=1702923166\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/08904cf995bd12a622d3b1d9ee006b2a.poster.avif?t=1702923166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/08904cf995bd12a622d3b1d9ee006b2a.webm?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/08904cf995bd12a622d3b1d9ee006b2a.mp4?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Sanguine tells the story of Yona, a cursed warrior in her quest for revenge as she battles her way through a dry medieval world filled with blood powered machines.<br>Expect advanced combat involving weapon switching, blood ability, intense boss fight and explore a complex world with a rich narrative to follow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/9bdb0c7eff4858cddbb435b8598d5fc5.poster.avif?t=1702923166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/9bdb0c7eff4858cddbb435b8598d5fc5.webm?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/9bdb0c7eff4858cddbb435b8598d5fc5.mp4?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Project Background</strong></h2>Developed initially as a student graduation project, we decided to continue working on it hoping to release it one day. We're a group of 3 passionate artists who love inventing unique worlds, characters, fun gameplay mechanics or just creating games of all kinds.  <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/bb5fab67471d2b2accb2654028f5402f.poster.avif?t=1702923166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/bb5fab67471d2b2accb2654028f5402f.webm?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/bb5fab67471d2b2accb2654028f5402f.mp4?t=1702923166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Future of Sanguine</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A playable demo of Sanguine release in September<br></li><li> Devlogs for a deeper look at the project development<br></li><li> A Discord Server for play-testing and feedback</li></ul>Sanguine is still very early in development, but if you are interested you can follow us to witness the evolution of the project. Join the community, it would mean a lot to us ! <br><br><br>                                                                                                                                                                                     Thank you for any kind support!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503430/extras/8fe227312f20f8cb8ee9fd7d4572206b.avif?t=1702923166\" /></span>",
